A teacher must not be able to record teaching progress for another teacher's class or subject merely by changing request parameters.

A teacher must not be able to authorize an assessment for another teacher's assignment.

Administrative access must follow existing platform roles and permissions. Administrative oversight must not silently substitute for the assigned subject teacher's academic authorization.

