20. FINAL ACCEPTANCE CRITERION

Phase A is complete only when the following statement is true:

A teacher can record what they actually taught to an assigned class and subject; the platform persistently verifies the teacher's assignment and resolves the taught topics and learning objectives against the correct NERDC curriculum version; Curriculum Flow reports progress from those records; and the existing mid-term AI generator can generate questions only from verified taught-topic evidence that the assigned teacher has explicitly authorized. All generated assessments remain inside the existing question-bank and examination-management workflow.

